{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550317493,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799ae9ffehgaY2UX9uAVWD2","part":{"partID":"prt_1d388a98d001lXA14ou0MgFe93","sessionID":"ses_e2c799ae9ffehgaY2UX9uAVWD2","messageID":"msg_1d388a169001ipj5QMRdsGW67n","type":"tool","id":"call_00_Xj27Ec27Vj5exWoBQyfA4938","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - Command Surfacing (doctor-install lineage)\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for the doctor-install fan-out lineage of the command-surfacing review. Records dimension coverage, findings, exhausted approaches, and next focus.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Init populated review charter, dimensions, and boundaries.\n- Per iteration the reviewer updates completed dimensions, running counts, and next focus.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview of command surfacing in the changed-file set listed by `review-scope.txt`, restricted to the `doctor-install` area plus shared docs that describe it. Focus: behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh; safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not assessing unchanged doctor surfaces outside the declared scope list.\n- Not assessing accuracy metrics quality beyond holdout hygiene and doc/code agreement.\n- No implementation or fix work; findings only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence at weighted new-finding ratio below 0.10, or 5 iterations.\n- Any confirmed P0 halts the PASS verdict regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: doctor-install scripts that encode per-runtime behaviour (`agents-md-check.cjs`, `agents-md-embed.cjs`, `hook-wiring-check.cjs`, `codex-hook-approval-check.cjs`)\n- Reason: cross-runtime branch logic is the highest-blast-radius part of the change set\n- Rotation status: first pass\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none yet\n- Required evidence: direct read of each branch plus its CLI call site\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `review-scope.txt` `doctor-install` rows (28 files) plus shared docs `INSTALL-SKILLED.md`, `.skilled/agents/orchestrate.md`, and system-skill-advisor SKILL/README/ARCHITECTURE.\n- Behavior claims: doctor command surfaces install/setup/agents-md/skill-advisor workflows consistently across six runtimes; mutating offers stay safe; holdout rows are never read by doctor or scoring paths; docs match code.\n- Reuse and conventions: existing doctor assets under `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/`, shared helper scripts under `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/`.\n- Review risks and gaps: review scope spans four areas; this lineage only owns `doctor-install`; cross-area claims cite shared docs as context evidence only.\n- Prior context: no prior review session for this packet (`review/` holds only the fan-out config, scope list, and lineage directories).\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-doctor-install-1794550137809-1ecgc7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T10:15:00.000Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"# Deep Review Strategy - Command Surfacing (doctor-install lineage)\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent brain for the doctor-install fan-out lineage of the command-surfacing review. Records dimension coverage, findings, exhausted approaches, and next focus.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- Init populated review charter, dimensions, and boundaries.\\n- Per iteration the reviewer updates completed dimensions, running counts, and next focus.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview of command surfacing in the changed-file set listed by `review-scope.txt`, restricted to the `doctor-install` area plus shared docs that describe it. Focus: behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh; safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants