ared docs as context evidence only.\n102: - Prior context: no prior review session for this packet (`review/` holds only the fan-out config, scope list, and lineage directories).\n103: \n104: ---\n105: \n106: ## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n107: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n108: | Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n109: |----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n110: | `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n111: | `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n112: | `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n113: | `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n114: | `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n115: | `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n116: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n117: \n118: ---\n119: \n120: ## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n121: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n122: | File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n123: |------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n124: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n125: \n126: ---\n127: \n128: ## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n129: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n130: - Max iterations: 5\n131: - Convergence threshold: 0.10\n132: - Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n133: - No-progress threshold: 0.05\n134: - Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n135: - Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-doctor-install-1794550137809-1ecgc7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n136: - Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n137: - Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n138: - Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n139: - Severity threshold: P2\n140: - Review target type: spec-folder\n141: - Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n142: - Started: 2026-11-13T10:15:00.000Z\n143: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed