{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550721209,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799ae9ffehgaY2UX9uAVWD2","part":{"partID":"prt_1d38ee4b3001xfNlEaMG1gIfi2","sessionID":"ses_e2c799ae9ffehgaY2UX9uAVWD2","messageID":"msg_1d38edce0001s33mK8RR7kMFxb","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ET_QeST9wprmwOsWNdGp1wK7209","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"### **Codex approval check parses only the nested hook shape** — ruled out: `.codex/hooks.json` wraps its events in `hooks`, and `codex-hook-approval-check.cjs:108` reads that shape; the broader top-level acceptance in `hook-wiring-check.cjs` is a superset, not a disagreement. -- BLOCKED (iteration 1, 1 attempts)","oldString":"### **`expect: [\"absent\"]` is dead for `.codex/AGENTS.md` in every state** — narrowed, not ruled out: a regular identical copy is still a FINDING at `:720-722`; only the symlink branch bypasses the expectation. -- BLOCKED (iteration 1, 1 attempts)\n- What was tried: **`expect: [\"absent\"]` is dead for `.codex/AGENTS.md` in every state** — narrowed, not ruled out: a regular identical copy is still a FINDING at `:720-722`; only the symlink branch bypasses the expectation.\n- Why blocked: Repeated iteration evidence ruled this direction out.\n- Do NOT retry: **`expect: [\"absent\"]` is dead for `.codex/AGENTS.md` in every state** — narrowed, not ruled out: a regular identical copy is still a FINDING at `:720-722`; only the symlink branch bypasses the expectation.\n\n### **Codex approval check parses only the nested hook shape** — ruled out: `.codex/hooks.json` wraps its events in `hooks`, and `codex-hook-approval-check.cjs:108` reads that shape; the broader top-level acceptance in `hook-wiring-check.cjs` is a superset, not a disagreement. -- BLOCKED (iteration 1, 1 attempts)","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing